# Nothing in the app reads a VITE_* variable today.
#
# The API prefix is NOT one: it is fixed at /api/v1 and lives in
# src/constants/routes.ts as API_PREFIX, because nginx.conf's SSE location
# and the Google OAuth anchor hardcode it too — a variable that moved only the
# axios base would break Google sign-in and that location silently. See the
# README's "The API prefix is fixed".
#
# This file is kept so that adding a real variable has somewhere to go.
